cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file, and cite Cavalcante et al. (2018) for the method."
type: software
title: "Fast Screened Coulomb"
abstract: "C library that computes screened interaction potentials between charge carriers in layered dielectric (van der Waals) systems with the electrostatic transfer-matrix method, and fits them with fast expansions for use in inner loops."
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-06"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ItaloAlb/fast-screened-coulomb"
authors:
